  "body": "**Blocked by:** #173\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #173; #175 is the next sequential slice of the `operations` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd one-domain Caddy: automatic TLS/HTTP2, compression, HSTS without includeSubDomains/preload, JSON stderr log, reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080, /api/sync WebSocket and Graph webhook. Use mutually exclusive 16MB default and 2GB POST /api/files body matchers. Open nftables only 22/80/443 and explicitly bind API, gateway, PostgreSQL and MinIO to loopback.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No proxy auth/rate/IP/CORS or subdomains.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- All public routes work through one domain.\n- Only POST /api/files accepts above 16MB up to 2GB.\n- Internal ports are unreachable externally.\n- Headers/logging match policy.\n",
